ls, captivating lore, and stunning visuals. Discover hidden secrets, uncover ancient mysteries, and experience a rich narrative woven into the gameplay. As the realm teeters on the brink of war, six powerful guilds rise to claim the empty throne. Choose your allegiance from the valiant Lionheart Legion to the covert Dark Veil. Each of the six guilds brings unique strengths, magical abilities, and cunning tactics to the chessboard battlefield. The fate of Nepharalis is in your hands! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077910/extras/6b51de012f0ca729045c603f75a656a7.avif?t=1747043843\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p>",
